WEBVTT

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:08.820
I'm so deeply moved right now!

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:12.700
And I'm grateful to summer and the heat!

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:16.850
I think this might be too tight around my chest.

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:19.990
It looks great on you.

00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:24.880
We only came here to observe.

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:32.470
All right! Let me join you!

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:33.920
Hold it!

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:36.890
Damn it! Let go!

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:38.600
Shiba, where's Ruru-san?

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:40.180
I don't see her anywhere.

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:41.020
What?

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.800
She hasn't changed yet?

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:47.450
I wonder what kind of swimsuit Ruru-san wears.

00:00:47.450 --> 00:00:49.760
Do you think it could be a bikini?

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:51.030
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:59.270
Why are we heading into such

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:03.530
a harsh environment?

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:10.660
Are you training for something?

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:13.250
Why is she wearing her usual clothes?

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:48.060
Legendary Swimsuit

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:49.760
It's so cold.

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:51.260
It feels great.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:54.320
We were right to come.

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:55.100
Yeah.

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:58.610
Shibaki's club president has 
some good ideas sometimes.

00:02:58.690 --> 00:03:01.110
<b>MDC Presents: Let's Swim at the Beach!
Recruiting participants!!
Transportation and Food Free
for Girls!
A chance to wear a legendary swimsuit!!</b>

00:03:05.070 --> 00:03:06.660
Legendary swimsuit...

00:03:12.680 --> 00:03:14.420
You're not gonna change?

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:19.260
Aren't they embarrassed to be 
wearing those scraps of cloth?

00:03:19.770 --> 00:03:21.690
That's how they're supposed to look.

00:03:21.690 --> 00:03:23.720
They're practically the uniform of summer.

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:25.450
I see.

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:27.480
I wanna try one on.

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:28.630
They're cute.

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:31.520
Cute?

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:33.520
Shibaraku!

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:35.520
I'm coming!

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:37.780
Rurumo, go get changed.

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:39.990
And <i>you</i> would just cause trouble again,

00:03:40.290 --> 00:03:42.400
so don't transform, Chiro.

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:44.300
Later!

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:49.080
Ya think sayin' that will 
make me behave myself?

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:51.250
What an idiot!

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:53.190
Excuse me...

00:03:54.020 --> 00:03:55.790
This is for you.

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:58.090
<b>Tea</b>

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:58.090
Thank you.

00:03:58.870 --> 00:04:02.260
It's to thank you for watching our stuff.

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:05.420
I can't believe you even wore 
a witch's outfit to the beach.

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:07.300
Is there something wrong with that?

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:11.810
No... I just thought, you're 
quite a hardcore cosplayer!

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:15.460
Um...

00:04:16.430 --> 00:04:18.830
If you like, maybe you could come to my place...

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:20.480
Your place?

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:22.680
W-We could hang out...

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:25.410
You want me to go to your place? All right.

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:26.370
Really?

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:27.970
<i>Then...</i>

00:04:31.390 --> 00:04:33.760
Your face is red. Do you have a fever?

00:04:33.760 --> 00:04:35.360
N-No!

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:36.500
Bye!

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:39.690
The summer uniform...

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:45.740
Apparently the legendary swimsuit
is kept in a shrine on this cape.

00:04:45.740 --> 00:04:47.490
Let's go, Shibaraku!

00:04:47.490 --> 00:04:50.850
We will confirm the truth with our own hands!

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:53.890
Doesn't this make your heart race, Shibaraku?

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:56.400
Yahoo!

00:04:56.670 --> 00:04:58.720
Yay!

00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:04.120
<i>Such a nice view...</i>

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:06.840
<i>Internal movie, switch on!</i>

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:08.580
<i>What a beautiful sight.</i>

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:10.910
<i>I could die happy right now.</i>

00:05:11.150 --> 00:05:12.990
It's so nice and cold.

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:14.430
I know, right?

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:15.250
<i>Those voices!</i>

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:17.920
<i>It's Tanako-chan and Sawashita-san!</i>

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:19.820
<i>They're huge!</i>

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:22.380
<i>Huh? Wait, Shiba's missing.</i>

00:05:27.330 --> 00:05:29.380
Why don't we go out there?

00:05:30.130 --> 00:05:31.600
Okay, let's go.

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:32.330
Huh?

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:35.480
Yahoo!

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:37.310
This is awesome!

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:39.060
Yahoo!

00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:42.350
No indecent behavior!

00:05:42.350 --> 00:05:43.660
That's a hundred-point penalty!

00:05:43.660 --> 00:05:47.580
You're unforgivable, Shibaki the pervert!

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:50.200
A pervert? I'll arrest him!

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:51.950
Yahoo!

00:05:56.330 --> 00:06:00.960
Looks like the heat has made 
Shiba-kun a lot more uninhibited.

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:03.450
I wanna do that, too.

00:06:03.450 --> 00:06:04.080
Huh?

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:06.300
Yahoo!

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:08.660
Yahoo!

00:06:08.940 --> 00:06:11.890
Your shameless behavior stops now, 
you perverted brothers!

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:13.100
What?

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:17.060
Your swimsuit is cute today, Inoue.

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:18.230
Huh?

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:19.980
You look nice, too, Shimomura-san!

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:21.810
R-Really?

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:24.050
Izumi-san, you look great, too.

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:25.860
Great...

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:27.160
It's true, seriously!

00:06:27.160 --> 00:06:28.460
You totally feel like a little sister!

00:06:28.460 --> 00:06:30.380
Ruru-san's the only one for me.

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:31.820
Sorry!

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:38.160
Damn! I can't believe I fell for that...

00:06:38.640 --> 00:06:40.520
Wait!

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:44.630
<b>State Power</b>

00:06:41.110 --> 00:06:43.780
Leave the perverts to me!

00:06:44.940 --> 00:06:46.360
Th-They're huge!

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:48.180
Compared to Sawashita-san's, those...

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:49.390
...are way bigger!

00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:50.590
She's a cow!

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:56.060
<b>State Power</b>

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:52.850
I'm Iida of the Nishimachi Police.

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:55.620
Give yourselves up, you perverts!

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:02.990
What makes you think you can headbutt me?!

00:07:05.620 --> 00:07:06.530
Amazing!

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:10.580
Don't underestimate the power of the state.

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:18.200
There's nothing I can't do right now.

00:07:19.050 --> 00:07:21.620
All these swimsuit cuties on the beach...

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.590
are mine!

00:07:26.820 --> 00:07:28.520
Wait, you pervert!

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:30.260
Someone stop him!

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:34.970
No one can stop me!

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:41.520
There.

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:47.480
Sorry.

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:51.450
Well, idiot? Am I cute?

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:52.950
Th-That's...

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:55.990
The legendary seashell swimsuit!

00:07:58.360 --> 00:08:01.000
Stay away!

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:03.790
Shibakaru, where are you?

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:08.460
I can't believed you dropped a block on me.

00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:10.960
They told me to stop you.

00:08:11.440 --> 00:08:13.900
We did it to stop your crimes 
at the water's edge.

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:15.480
Say what?

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:18.080
Thank you, Iida-san.

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:20.810
This boy always gives us trouble.

00:08:21.240 --> 00:08:22.680
We appreciate your help.

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:26.020
Let me know if you ever need a hand.

00:08:27.830 --> 00:08:30.940
Hey, you're the girl from the 
other day, aren't you?

00:08:31.480 --> 00:08:33.950
Huh? Rurumo, you know her?

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:38.470
You don't recognize me?

00:08:38.470 --> 00:08:41.450
I showed you how to get to the station.

00:08:41.780 --> 00:08:42.470
Oh...

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:45.280
Thank you for that.

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:48.050
Oh, she showed you the way, huh?

00:08:48.050 --> 00:08:53.050
Thank you for helping my sister!

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:54.280
No.

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:57.220
Well, I should get going.

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:58.890
Um, as long as you're here,

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:01.640
why don't we play beach volleyball together?

00:09:01.960 --> 00:09:03.230
That sounds great!

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:05.320
Then let's play!

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:06.690
Okay!

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:09.730
Go on. I'll watch our stuff.

00:09:10.090 --> 00:09:11.980
Go play. It's fun.

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:13.990
It's fine.

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:15.950
Sorry.

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:18.320
All right!

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:19.390
There!

00:09:20.670 --> 00:09:21.280
There!

00:09:21.280 --> 00:09:22.290
Take that!

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:30.290
Everyone's wearing swimsuits, so there's 
nothing to be embarrassed about.

00:09:31.230 --> 00:09:34.510
I want to see you in a swimsuit, too.

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:39.300
By the way, what kind of swimsuit did you get?

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:43.220
Didn't you buy one at the department 
store before coming to the beach?

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:46.740
Is that why we went?

00:09:46.740 --> 00:09:47.660
Huh?

00:09:48.530 --> 00:09:50.720
<i>I'm going to go buy dinner.</i>

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:52.750
<i>I'm gonna go get an awesome one.</i>

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:54.360
<i>You go pick one for yourself.</i>

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:01.370
Don't tell me you didn't buy one...

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:05.540
It can't be helped.

00:10:07.310 --> 00:10:08.870
I'm going to go buy drinks.

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.380
R-Rurumo!

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:13.750
That's right.

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:17.050
Of course Rurumo doesn't know about swimsuits.

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:21.800
But the beach is so boring without a swimsuit.

00:10:22.530 --> 00:10:24.020
What should I do?

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:27.230
All right!

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:28.690
<b>Beach Shack</b>

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:32.610
They're so expensive!

00:10:34.010 --> 00:10:36.580
Do you guys rent swimsuits?

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:38.360
No, we don't.

00:10:38.640 --> 00:10:39.520
Sorry!

00:10:39.520 --> 00:10:41.810
Someone lend me a swimsuit! Anyone will do!

00:10:41.810 --> 00:10:43.990
Huh? What are you talking about, you pervert?

00:10:45.510 --> 00:10:46.750
Damn it...

00:10:47.180 --> 00:10:50.960
Someone just lend me a swimsuit!

00:10:52.050 --> 00:10:53.920
Wait!

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:56.520
Seashell swimsuit girl!

00:10:54.730 --> 00:10:56.520
No!

00:10:56.520 --> 00:10:59.550
Chiro! I told her not to transform...

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:00.840
That's it!

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:06.950
Over here, Chiro!

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:09.240
Idiot!

00:11:09.240 --> 00:11:10.980
Huh? Where did she go?

00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:13.300
They never give up.

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:18.240
Oh, th-this swimsuit, uh...

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:21.320
I'll let you off the hook if 
you lend me that swimsuit.

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:25.470
Rurumo doesn't have one.

00:11:25.470 --> 00:11:28.110
Without that, there's no point 
in her coming to the beach.

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:30.410
So I need your swimsuit!

00:11:30.780 --> 00:11:33.000
Rurumo's way more shy 
than the average person.

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:35.960
She'd never wear somethin' this skimpy.

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:41.470
I thought it was a good idea...

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:43.010
Leave it to me.

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:46.570
I'll find a swimsuit perfect for Rurumo.

00:11:46.570 --> 00:11:47.430
Chiro...

00:11:47.880 --> 00:11:49.560
It's for Rurumo!

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:52.420
Rurumo and I are bound by a powerful bond!

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:53.020
See ya!

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:55.110
All right... I'll look, too.

00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:59.780
Swimsuit, swimsuit, swimsuit, 
swimsuit, swimsuit...

00:12:01.100 --> 00:12:03.010
I know where we can find a swimsuit!

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:03.740
Huh?

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:09.640
<b>Sasahara Store</b>

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:08.120
I'm sure there was a store around here...

00:12:17.410 --> 00:12:19.880
Is there really one around here?

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:22.480
Yes. According to the texts,

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:26.340
the legendary swimsuit has existed 
on this cape since the Showa Era.

00:12:26.790 --> 00:12:28.310
Legendary?

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:32.340
When a timid and shy girl put it on,

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:36.760
her personality would become assertive, 
and she'd successfully confess her love.

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:39.180
It's said she would find love.

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:43.090
What kind of swimsuit is it?

00:12:43.090 --> 00:12:44.910
I'm glad you asked, Shibaraku.

00:12:45.230 --> 00:12:49.320
It is a priceless garment that has been 
spoken of on this cape since ancient times.

00:12:49.320 --> 00:12:53.240
Instantly changing the personality 
of anyone who wears it,

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:54.700
it is truly a legendary swimsuit!

00:12:54.700 --> 00:12:56.880
<i>More nonsense...</i>

00:12:57.110 --> 00:13:01.440
Today's goal is to find the swimsuit 
and verify its powers.

00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:06.000
You mean that's the whole 
reason you planned this trip?

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:08.620
Knowing Sawashita-san and 
her friends would come...

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:10.260
Of course.

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:13.520
A larger sample size means higher credibility.

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:16.730
We'll begin by testing it on the prodigy girl.

00:13:17.030 --> 00:13:18.760
Wh-Why would you start with Rurumo?

00:13:18.760 --> 00:13:20.500
I heard she doesn't have a swimsuit.

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:21.980
She's the perfect candidate.

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:23.200
No, no, no, no!

00:13:23.200 --> 00:13:26.370
<i>I can't let her wear a freakish swimsuit like that!</i>

00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:28.190
I'm terribly excited!

00:13:28.190 --> 00:13:30.990
<i>Well, I'm sure it doesn't exist anyway.</i>

00:13:31.300 --> 00:13:34.520
<i>But there's still a chance that it does...</i>

00:13:35.010 --> 00:13:37.460
<i>As soon as I find it, I'll dispose of it.</i>

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:39.080
Senpai!

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:40.240
Let's go!

00:13:40.240 --> 00:13:42.380
Let's confirm the truth with our own hands!

00:13:43.930 --> 00:13:47.260
<i>Shibaraku, have you finally realized 
the appeal of the mysterious?</i>

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:52.220
Which way is the beach?

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:55.680
Rurumo!

00:13:59.900 --> 00:14:01.660
I found a swimsuit.

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:06.740
<i>I want to see you in a swimsuit, too.</i>

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:21.000
<b>Headbutt</b>

00:14:17.060 --> 00:14:21.000
<b>School Swimsuit</b>

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:25.480
My heartbeat is soaring to heights unknown.

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:28.220
Such unscientific non-human power!

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:31.530
This is the kind of mystery 
we have been searching for!

00:14:31.530 --> 00:14:33.600
Don't you agree, Shibaraku?

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:35.470
R-Right.

00:14:39.330 --> 00:14:40.780
Senpai, look!

00:14:41.320 --> 00:14:43.360
There it is! This is the shrine!

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:46.330
I-It's not here.

00:14:46.840 --> 00:14:50.000
According to the texts, it should be here...

00:14:50.760 --> 00:14:53.580
<i>It never existed to begin with.</i>

00:14:53.860 --> 00:14:58.480
The legendary swimsuit!

00:15:04.490 --> 00:15:05.330
<i>But...</i>

00:15:06.080 --> 00:15:09.340
<i>What should I do about a swimsuit?</i>

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:12.970
What is this?

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:19.100
These are Rurumo's...

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:20.090
But why?

00:15:22.110 --> 00:15:23.360
Kota...

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:26.820
Why, if it isn't the prodigy girl!

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:31.780
Y-You...

00:15:34.190 --> 00:15:37.640
Where did you get that swimsuit?

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:42.670
This is my first time wearing one.

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:44.170
It's quite itchy.

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:48.630
Are they all like this?

00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:52.950
<i>Not good.</i>

00:15:54.020 --> 00:15:55.390
<i>This is not good.</i>

00:15:58.870 --> 00:16:01.230
E-Everyone's waiting. Let's head back.

00:16:05.490 --> 00:16:06.940
This place will do.

00:16:08.060 --> 00:16:09.030
For what?

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:09.440
Whoa!

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:13.120
You're always taking care of me.

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:15.390
I'll reward you...

00:16:16.140 --> 00:16:17.370
with a kiss.

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:24.580
<i>A kiss!</i>

00:16:25.270 --> 00:16:28.500
<i>She's changed too much!</i>

00:16:33.900 --> 00:16:35.040
Let me give you...

00:16:35.700 --> 00:16:36.590
a kiss.

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:42.920
<i>I-If someone says they'll give 
you something, you must accept...</i>

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:45.060
<i>If someone says they'll give 
you something, you must accept.</i>

00:16:45.150 --> 00:16:46.440
<i>If someone says they'll give 
you something, you must accept.</i>

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:47.530
<i>If someone says they'll give 
you something, you must accept.</i>

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:48.860
<i>If someone says they'll give 
you something, you must accept.</i>

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:52.070
<i>My first kiss is about to</i>

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:54.490
<i>rain down on me!</i>

00:16:54.970 --> 00:16:56.910
<i>Thank you, legendary swimsuit!</i>

00:16:57.340 --> 00:17:00.870
<i>Thank you, alternate personality!</i>

00:17:02.740 --> 00:17:05.350
On second thought, this feels wrong somehow!

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:07.710
He ran.

00:17:11.830 --> 00:17:14.880
Even her physical ability has changed!

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:16.300
Idiot!

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:16.870
Chiro!

00:17:16.870 --> 00:17:17.550
This way!

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:23.310
I'm saved.

00:17:23.550 --> 00:17:25.600
The moment Rurumo put that on,

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:27.820
she started runnin' crazy fast,

00:17:27.820 --> 00:17:29.590
and I lost sight of her.

00:17:29.590 --> 00:17:31.910
Where did you find that swimsuit?

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:32.780
In that

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:35.280
old lookin' house over there.

00:17:38.610 --> 00:17:40.330
It really does exist?

00:17:40.590 --> 00:17:42.450
That's a cursed swimsuit.

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:43.850
A cursed swimsuit?

00:17:43.850 --> 00:17:45.120
What's that?

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:47.500
It changes your personality 
when you put it on.

00:17:47.910 --> 00:17:49.730
How come you didn't know?

00:17:49.730 --> 00:17:51.660
You're a magical cat!

00:17:51.660 --> 00:17:52.800
How should I know, idiot?

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:55.000
We don't have those in the spirit world!

00:17:55.980 --> 00:17:59.340
But a cursed swimsuit, eh?

00:18:00.060 --> 00:18:02.810
So the swimsuit's mysterious 
power must be resonatin'

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:06.020
with Rurumo's magic to amplify its effect.

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:09.900
We need to think of a way to 
turn her back to normal...

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:11.910
There you are.

00:18:15.560 --> 00:18:16.610
Move!

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:18.030
Get out of the way!

00:18:22.420 --> 00:18:23.410
No!

00:18:29.110 --> 00:18:30.910
No!

00:18:35.560 --> 00:18:36.710
Sorry!

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:40.720
Move, Brother.

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:42.430
Brother!

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:46.190
Fast...

00:18:46.190 --> 00:18:47.100
Yeah.

00:18:47.780 --> 00:18:50.150
We gotta get the swimsuit off her.

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:51.560
I guess it's the only way!

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:55.070
Guys, help me get Rurumo's swimsuit off!

00:18:55.560 --> 00:18:57.030
There you go again!

00:18:57.490 --> 00:18:58.680
You shameless pervert!

00:18:58.680 --> 00:19:00.490
Saw that coming.

00:19:00.890 --> 00:19:02.900
Damn it! What should we do?

00:19:11.910 --> 00:19:14.340
Accept your reward.

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:16.280
I can't move...

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:17.770
Neither can I.

00:19:18.120 --> 00:19:19.450
Damn it!

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:22.760
N-No, wait!

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:25.470
This is a bad idea! A really bad idea!

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:27.430
Rurumo!

00:19:27.720 --> 00:19:29.130
Wake up!

00:19:29.130 --> 00:19:31.410
<i>Damn it! What should I do?</i>

00:19:32.430 --> 00:19:34.110
Magic, activate!

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:36.570
Only to the step before that!

00:19:44.400 --> 00:19:45.910
A UFO!

00:19:46.280 --> 00:19:48.620
I saw a mysterious phenomenon!

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:50.060
Baltus.

00:19:53.320 --> 00:19:56.850
Right before Rurumo uses her magic,

00:19:56.850 --> 00:19:58.630
she always reverts to her witch's outfit.

00:19:59.540 --> 00:20:01.420
Not bad thinkin' for an idiot.

00:20:04.370 --> 00:20:05.950
What was that?

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:07.460
She speed-changed.

00:20:07.460 --> 00:20:08.850
Amazing!

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:11.740
Your wish, Kota.

00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:15.650
The legendary swimsuit was real...

00:20:15.820 --> 00:20:19.040
Ya look real disappointed.

00:20:19.640 --> 00:20:20.530
No...

00:20:21.020 --> 00:20:22.910
This was for the best.

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:31.520
Be careful.

00:20:31.520 --> 00:20:32.750
Bye!

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:36.140
Don't get in too much trouble.

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:36.790
<b>Safety First</b>

00:20:37.990 --> 00:20:39.420
By the way, Senpai,

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:41.840
did you find the legendary swimsuit?

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:45.360
Unfortunately, I didn't find it.

00:20:45.360 --> 00:20:48.760
However, seeing that UFO was worthwhile.

00:20:49.310 --> 00:20:52.870
Then what did you think of my swimsuit?

00:20:52.870 --> 00:20:53.900
I don't remember.

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:01.530
Why am I tanned?

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:02.780
How was it?

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:04.890
Your first beach experience.

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:12.700
There!

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:16.920
It was fun.

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:18.300
Yeah?

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:20.260
Glad to hear it.

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:42.760
<i>Maybe I really did make a mistake...</i>

00:23:21.380 --> 00:23:23.830
Hey, do witches have levels?

00:23:23.830 --> 00:23:25.590
Of course they do. Rurumo is...

00:23:25.590 --> 00:23:26.960
...just a trainee witch.

00:23:27.400 --> 00:23:28.920
Who the heck are you?

00:23:29.530 --> 00:23:33.010
The next episode is 
"Rank 1 Witch Haruriri Descends."

00:23:30.470 --> 00:23:35.020
<b>Next Episode: Rank 1 Witch Haruriri Descends</b>

00:23:33.010 --> 00:23:34.560
It's been a while.
